          "expr": "sum(rate({__name__=~\"starter_api_http_requests(_total)?\",status_code=~\"5..\"}[5m])) / clamp_min(sum(rate({__name__=~\"starter_api_http_requests(_total)?\"}[5m])), 0.000001)",
